{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loftia is a cozy multiplayer game about building a life in the sky. Set across floating islands, you\u2019ll farm, craft, decorate, and explore alongside friends in a shared world that grows over time. Whether you\u2019re hanging out after a long day or teaming up for a bigger adventure, Loftia is a place to slow down, connect, and create something meaningful together. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the world of Loftia, you can:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/2d3511f03b40d43497b5e4f8b702001f.avif?t=1772152697\" width=1560 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/cc947f5f175aaaa0a9d6ab1041a30632.poster.avif?t=1772152697\" width=1170 height=678 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/cc947f5f175aaaa0a9d6ab1041a30632.webm?t=1772152697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/cc947f5f175aaaa0a9d6ab1041a30632.mp4?t=1772152697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master sustainable farming techniques like hydroponics, aquaponics, and trellis farming. Craft your own tools using renewable energy generated from the sun, wind and rain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/31c53a0364e7f21824efda31c5179edc.avif?t=1772152697\" width=1560 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/4aef47cbf3819756482c73089290df48.poster.avif?t=1772152697\" width=1170 height=688 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/4aef47cbf3819756482c73089290df48.webm?t=1772152697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/4aef47cbf3819756482c73089290df48.mp4?t=1772152697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a character that feels fully like you, and design your home in the style you love. There's a super wide variety of different options and aesthetics for you to choose from!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/006acbec5fc739a262351b9150133638.avif?t=1772152697\" width=1560 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/aa5e0a525f7c1177ad38f526017a4a8b.poster.avif?t=1772152697\" width=1170 height=688 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/aa5e0a525f7c1177ad38f526017a4a8b.webm?t=1772152697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/aa5e0a525f7c1177ad38f526017a4a8b.mp4?t=1772152697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salvage discarded materials and turn them into something useful or beautiful, from planters made of old tires to furniture crafted from reclaimed wood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/3286396371fd4ccfdae6f3dc126270fd.avif?t=1772152697\" width=1560 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/9f0b31bd0c68ad3acbb999788b8528f0.poster.avif?t=1772152697\" width=1170 height=678 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/9f0b31bd0c68ad3acbb999788b8528f0.webm?t=1772152697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/9f0b31bd0c68ad3acbb999788b8528f0.mp4?t=1772152697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture beyond the city to scavenge in abandoned factories, solve puzzles, and take on group quests across different biomes. Team up when you want, or explore at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/d44a80f17f4561154640aa7fa646189b.avif?t=1772152697\" width=1560 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/d5c6ff60a0d565f0c83348d3e6253eac.poster.avif?t=1772152697\" width=1170 height=678 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/d5c6ff60a0d565f0c83348d3e6253eac.webm?t=1772152697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/d5c6ff60a0d565f0c83348d3e6253eac.mp4?t=1772152697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Rescue and adopt animals to join you on your journey, from capybaras and turtles to other unique species. Bring them along, dress them up, and let them keep you company as you explore the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/e9bbeb5daccd2cb5831678a351d70241.avif?t=1772152697\" width=1560 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/90fa10cd81163ce9d91d9193c85bd7ea.poster.avif?t=1772152697\" width=1170 height=678 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/90fa10cd81163ce9d91d9193c85bd7ea.webm?t=1772152697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/90fa10cd81163ce9d91d9193c85bd7ea.mp4?t=1772152697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together on community projects that help the world grow. By contributing to shared builds, you\u2019ll unlock new resources, uncover hidden stories, and open up new islands to explore.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2320980?t=1772152697","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2320980?t=1772152697","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/6ff52a8a7a58aa161b11b838cb6f14abcb68f620/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772152697","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/6ff52a8a7a58aa161b11b838cb6f14abcb68f620/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772152697","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full contr