348d3e6253eac.mp4?t=1772152697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Rescue and adopt animals to join you on your journey, from capybaras and turtles to other unique species. Bring them along, dress them up, and let them keep you company as you explore the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/e9bbeb5daccd2cb5831678a351d70241.avif?t=1772152697\" width=1560 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/90fa10cd81163ce9d91d9193c85bd7ea.poster.avif?t=1772152697\" width=1170 height=678 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/90fa10cd81163ce9d91d9193c85bd7ea.webm?t=1772152697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/90fa10cd81163ce9d91d9193c85bd7ea.mp4?t=1772152697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together on community projects that help the world grow. By contributing to shared builds, you\u2019ll unlock new resources, uncover hidden stories, and open up new islands to explore.</p>","developers":["Qloud Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/header.jpg?t=1772152697","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 Monterey<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</st